      "sourceTextSha256": "5d059b49157035fd968cf2bb61278c6e40086bd1a246e91fddb63b1227e8fca0",
      "text": "The route, the timing of outings, and landings depend on the weather, ice, and sea conditions. Wildlife sightings depend on natural conditions.",
