      "sourceTextSha256": "b325a47daeaf45b0f668bf86ef1af3c34073fe6bc91283765f71cfc75ead04ed",
      "text": "Days 2–3 and 9–10 are described as crossings. The Antarctic programme covers days 4–8, with the expedition team deciding which activities take place on each day.",
